# Your four nodes, edit before anything else. Every script sources this file.
#
# SSH names of the four Sparks in RING (rank) order: rank 0 is the head, and
# each rank is cabled to rank-1 and rank+1 (rank 3 back to rank 0). The Flare
# agents are paired under these names (scripts/agents.sh).
SPARK_HOSTS="spark-0 spark-1 spark-2 spark-3"
# The head (rank 0) as the scripts reach it over SSH.
SPARK_HEAD="spark-0"
# The account that runs the ranks on every node: it builds Flare, owns
# ~/.cache/flare (packages, publisher profiles) and has passwordless sudo.
SPARK_USER="spark"
# Rank 0's address on the ring fabric. The ranks meet here every decode step:
# never a Wi-Fi or LAN address (on Wi-Fi this halved decode speed).
SPARK_HEAD_FABRIC="192.168.100.10"
# Fabric addresses of ranks 1, 2, 3 as rank 0 reaches them (agent pairing and
# the unit's peer check).
SPARK_RING_PEERS="192.168.100.11 192.168.104.13 192.168.101.12"
# Optional: ranks 1-3 as rank 0 reaches them over SSH, for crash recovery
# (bin/recover-card). Default: ranks 1-3 of SPARK_HOSTS.
# SPARK_RECOVER_PEERS="spark-1 spark-2 spark-3"
